 playful squirrel.The Helena Collection allows you to experience the sights and sounds of California'swine country on a very special night circa 1948. Take a stroll back in time toexperience the pleasure of a chilly holiday evening in St. Helena. Relax asgently falling snow dusts the vines, rabbits dart under a star streaked sky, andsmoke from a roaring fire drifts from the chimney of the Trinchero home.NOTE: Additional collections will become available for download fromhttp://www.sutterhome.com/moodmaker in the future.Have a wonderful time using the Sutter Home MoodMaker.------------------------------------------SYSTEM REQUIREMENTSMinimum Hardware: *  120 MHz Power PC *  64MB RAM [128 MB recommended] *  64MB available hard-disk space *  Color monitor with 16-bit [thousands of colors] capability *  Speakers *  28.8 speed modem or faster *  MouseSoftware: * Mac OS 7.6.1 or higher------------------------------------------INSTALLING SUTTER HOME MOODMAKERBefore installing, make sure you have an appropriate system configuration asdescribed above.NOTE: Sutter Home MoodMaker will only run under Mac OS 7.6.1 or higher. It willNOT run under earlier version of the Mac OS such as System 6.To install Sutter Home MoodMaker:1.  Start your Mac and insert the CD-ROM into your CD-ROM drive. 2.  Double-click on the CD-ROM icon labeled 'Sutter Home MoodMaker'. 3.  Double-click on the application file icon 'MoodMaker Full Installer'.4.  Follow the instructions on the screen. The installer will copy the appropriate files to your hard drive.Once you have installed Sutter Home MoodMaker, you can enjoy the soothing sightsand sounds of the California Wine country by double-clicking on the MoodMakerapplication icon in the 'Sutter Home MoodMaker' folder.-----------------------------------------------------TROUBLESHOOTINGSutter Home MoodMaker utilizes the latest in Beatnik soundmixing technology.  Ifyour Macintosh is at or near the minimum Hardware System Requirements listed, youmay experience slower animations and response time to button-clicking.On Macintosh systems with an operating system earlier than OS8.5, you mayexperience a freeze in your system clock display.  This is due to a limitation ofMacintosh multi-tasking.  To refresh your system clock display, send MoodMaker tothe background by clicking on your desktop or other applications.-------------------------------------------------------------------------  Sutter Home MoodMaker is copyright 2000 Sutter Home Winery. All rights reserved.Developed by Red Sky Interactive, San Francisco.  Go Bison.Windows(c) is a registered trademark of Microsoft Corporation.  PowerPC(tm) is a trademark of International Business Machines Corporation.  Apple, Macintosh, and Power Macintosh are trademarks of Apple Computer, Inc., registered in the U.S.A.and other countries.  Mac and the Mac OS logo are trademarks of Apple Computer,Inc.  Sutter Home MoodMaker was developed on Macintosh computers and is "Made withMacromedia."(tm)  Director(c) 1994-2000 Macromedia, Inc.  All other trademarks arethe property of their respective holders.Thank you for visiting the MoodMaker.  Enjoy!/dph/cac/000712 The End.-----------------installer v.1.0